msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s not true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そんなことないよ……。"

#: scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd4ea7456dffeeb56de7c8e8ac01b319b11508c452836d34d49a392491cbe1ea
#. default-sha256: 3b700edb07a49eb80b8dc6e492ff0998dd5bd22a5c1bfe1ad6cf28b64d1bba0b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tell me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if you can’t go today, when ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ you?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫When will you "
"be willing to go out with me?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ねえ、⟪k:2⟫今日がだめならいつが良いの？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫いつなら一緒にお出かけしてくれるの？"

#: scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a64153188ecb69bb8498c1602f4c7b0a4cf5d22f9fca740b682a25dd38520e97
#. default-sha256: f72eae0e64d1a481454f254fdd1915de4627b86c3eda29b8866db9dca5b3a8e6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When will you be willing to play cards with me?⟪k:1⟫To have tea together?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いつ、⟪k:1⟫一緒にカードゲームしたり、⟪k:2⟫お茶したりしてくれるの？"

#: scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 399252284e2475d64ab50c24dad8158c6bd8e78a5f52e210e64b9575333b5360
#. default-sha256: c796fc8f62321c94db1dd15e82f41864beac4239b797369a23dbe3d0ef8e797c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I... ⟪k:2⟫can’t make any promises.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have things to do—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫obligations."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And Nellie, you’re almost an adult yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫それは……確約出来ないよ。⟪k:2⟫僕だってやることは色々あるんだしさ……。⟪k:3⟫ネリー、⟪k:4⟫お"
"前もさ、⟪k:5⟫もう大人になるんだから。"

#: scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c492ab354a2ffd3bf195e030ee971761a663574fbac07a011b35931507d2d4f
#. default-sha256: 3e16e2fd613dae5782f3efb5b8149e348f58ea80f050680db2bcd37f4facb10f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop acting like such a child."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫子供っぽいことを言うのはよしなって。"

#: scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 437b5fe70183469be7476e4ad354d68ec39e71bcd7485a12b887775eacd1f651
#. default-sha256: 5f246eae70006b3087ca02e2bd9032aa6d6ebb440a29ed8f0f29006245a0d4b6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m not an adult yet!⟪k:2⟫I’m still a kid!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ネリーは大人じゃないもの、⟪k:2⟫まだ子供だもの！"

#: scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4e335a287149d8ecc52d8b3da16b654869ce2a9e73e971b7eefc1d7816e15f5
#. default-sha256: 78dca9b9256bdd4a6666c4a1f7f9ba1e98f44c2d0b42438cf8a34a8d6e127de7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If it means I don’t get to play with you anymore,⟪k:2⟫dearest Mell, then I don’t ⟪k:3⟫"
"want⟪k:4⟫ to be an adult!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お兄さまと遊べないようになるなら、⟪k:2⟫大人になんかなりたくないわ！"

#: scenario:scenario_C6699785_C044_4576_A771_11C8207F6A24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38a351e8bd0ac246d9f014d07619f6c09ef74104cecd4558dec52946328a9ff5
